 :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "q-342928/field-2/f3b9108d16694b7332ee26d397d781ba3d513f7b3536e0f02dcbdf329be88b74" :answer-field/choices ["q-342928/field-2/c5f95eef67b92e2acf03bcab45b69d6426986b6ff57cd34965b6bff97f96a605" "q-342928/field-2/c7e1f85c8715bd5e7ab55bc675253c17d68dbc62987334dbdeaeb93bd64fc0e5" "q-342928/field-2/f3b9108d16694b7332ee26d397d781ba3d513f7b3536e0f02dcbdf329be88b74" "q-342928/field-2/d2dd5f31f083a64be9c8a4d98d88c427406b153d1a3bbb0f279104ddaec5cfbf"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-342928/field-3/f8148a25bb58e3ec8802dcf55d973986c87c5a72c778e45b53cf35d92b247f7f" :answer/id #uuid "99fc16a3-25f9-5cca-a30e-3705f047d832" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-4{e}^{-3t}+2{e}^{-2t}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-342928/field-3/ff5c315526ee3b6caf765ef5c6a0511ba271b440c2d75f8b6c2f3724cad5cf3c" :answer/id #uuid "109cb8f4-4edb-5650-8468-dddbe422fcfb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2{e}^{-3t}-4{e}^{-2t}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-342928/field-3/27711de1ad9391e2a8cdc5f409836c4b7e22049927ac64715aca639efbc493b2" :answer/id #uuid "3b143573-25c8-5dc9-a5bc-2fa042c7704b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2{e}^{-3t}+4{e}^{-2t}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-342928/field-3/b10f7f0e799c9005797a8c097207db66d9bfd6f66c7d53d0831ad9e184f3eab8" :answer/id #uuid "ab0f8cc3-76bb-5ba3-a526-637c5f27f87f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{e}^{-3t}+{e}^{-2t}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-342928/field-3" :answer-field/id #uuid "91904cd2-3308-58bc-ba42-af2bd9d1c9b0" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "q-342928/field-3/27711de1ad9391e2a8cdc5f409836c4b7e22049927ac64715aca639efbc493b2" :answer-field/choices ["q-342928/field-3/f8148a25bb58e3ec8802dcf55d973986c87c5a72c778e45b53cf35d92b247f7f" "q-342928/field-3/ff5c315526ee3b6caf765ef5c6a0511ba271b440c2d75f8b6c2f3724cad5cf3c" "q-342928/field-3/27711de1ad9391e2a8cdc5f409836c4b7e22049927ac64715aca639efbc493b2" "q-342928/field-3/b10f7f0e799c9005797a8c097207db66d9bfd6f66c7d53d0831ad9e184f3eab8"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-342928" :question/id #uuid "1bebe255-48b8-5821-81d8-8df520eed6e5" :question/math-academy-id "q-342928" :question/problem "Consider the following initial value problem.\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}t}+3y=4{e}^{-2t},\\,y(0)=2\n$$\n\nSelect the correct options in the reasoning below to find the solution using Laplace transforms.\n\nLet $Y(s)=L{y(t)}.$ Taking the Laplace transform of both sides of the equation and solving for $Y,$ we have\n\n$$\nY(s)={{field-1}}.\n$$\n\nThe partial fraction decomposition of $Y$ is\n\n$$\nY(s)={{field-2}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution to the initial value problem is\n\n$$\ny(t)={{field-3}}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we take the Laplace transform of both sides of the differential equation. Using the linearity property, we have\n\n$$\nL{{y}^{′}}+3L{y}=L{4{e}^{-2t}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula for the transform of a derivative, $L{{y}^{′}}=sY(s)-y(0),$ and the standard transform \n\n$$\nL{{e}^{at}}=\\frac{1}{s-a},\\,s>a,\n$$\n\nwe substitute the known values. Note that $y(0)=2:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(sY(s)-2)+3Y(s) & =4\\cdot \\frac{1}{s+2} \\\\ (s+3)Y(s)-2 & =\\frac{4}{s+2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe rearrange to solve for $Y(s).$ First, add $2$ to the right-hand side and find a common denominator:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(s+3)Y(s) & =2+\\frac{4}{s+2} \\\\ (s+3)Y(s) & =\\frac{2(s+2)}{s+2}+\\frac{4}{s+2} \\\\ (s+3)Y(s) & =\\frac{2s+8}{s+2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nDividing by $(s+3),$ we obtain\n\n$$\nY(s)=\\frac{2s+8}{(s+3)(s+2)}.\n$$\n\nNext, we perform a partial fraction decomposition. We write $Y(s)$ in the form\n\n$$\n\\frac{2s+8}{(s+3)(s+2)}=\\frac{A}{s+3}+\\frac{B}{s+2}.\n$$\n\nTo find the constants $A$ and $B,$ we first clear the denominators:\n\n$$\n2s+8=A(s+2)+B(s+3)\n$$\n\nNow, we find the constants $A$ and $B.$\n\n- Setting $s=-3,$ we have\n\n$$\n2(-3)+8=A(-3+2)+B(0)\\,⟹\\,2=-1A\\,⟹\\,A=-2.\n$$\n\n- Setting $s=-2,$ we have\n\n$$\n2(-2)+8=A(0)+B(-2+3)\\,⟹\\,4=1B\\,⟹\\,B=4.\n$$\n\nThus, the decomposition is\n\n$$\nY(s)=-\\frac{2}{s+3}+\\frac{4}{s+2}.\n$$\n\nFrom the table of Laplace transforms, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{L}^{-1}{\\frac{1}{s+3}} & ={e}^{-3t} \\\\ {L}^{-1}{\\frac{1}{s+2}} & ={e}^{-2t}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, taking the inverse Laplace transform of $Y(s),$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y(t) & =-2{L}^{-1}{\\frac{1}{s+3}}+4{L}^{-1}{\\frac{1}{s+2}} \\\\ y(t) & =-2{e}^{-3t}+4{e}^{-2t}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-342928/field-1" "q-342928/field-2" "q-342928/field-3"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "5eae6b5d-adff-53b2-970d-f0dcee58365f"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-342928"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-342925/field-1/7099ad67e9c3c61612d78ac131e8ac062a94018feac161cd8078afdaec46e02e" :answer/id #uuid "05859868-a2d2-5839-814c-425e75ffd3a2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{(s+2)(s-3)}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-342925/field-1/23553ce0d5a5fc5ec1baffebd70d001a0683b48e6dbe62d8e2c02314f99b1930" :answer/id #uuid "7c2b75a1-e945-52df-bccf-124561b85ae8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{s+5}{(s+2)(s+3)}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-342925/field-1/a043c48feb9c3b5e4c883221e88e329d11449f52cc4ab5e93dbd05cbefca8f73" :answer/id #uuid "d13bd291-c482-5340-a0e0-d0d148b79fb5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{s+8}{(s+2)(s+3)}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-342925/field-1/ecd19eca85baff9b4da3af2baf5e7dcda365c585b7669e6c7d98b485e3aea278" :answer/id #uuid "2d283d4a-71fa-5e77-b0d4-c0481b83d836" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{5}{(s+2)(s+3)}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-342925/field-1/c7cfde4a914fbd3ccc6102