 :answer-field/id #uuid "22a81cf4-1dce-5481-8b59-f895c6252b68" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "q-342925/field-2/ba95dc590dfce26b1433b39c2502de875c66b3133817508f05e0658c295826f0" :answer-field/choices ["q-342925/field-2/ba95dc590dfce26b1433b39c2502de875c66b3133817508f05e0658c295826f0" "q-342925/field-2/c33ee2f864647911c95371743521a060b55d2240ec65a3925ba57ca4843e0dfe" "q-342925/field-2/779b3db522173fee43ae2432f40d599593c4f4f6e1a2ced2dd13d84ba8f0087b" "q-342925/field-2/da8d121667705d33addd5ddc54378ff5fe1e842533b5f09035d037eede32dcf0"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-342925/field-3/4ab281c3671a69db36411303f42cb15b9aafe5742f3680c61dbd346008ea420a" :answer/id #uuid "baac865f-2c57-54a6-9128-787ee4d327a7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5{e}^{-2t}-6{e}^{-3t}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-342925/field-3/7108c4464d1b2eea07bf53064655c7c7765fd4c5a1bb83ff500e7b974ed1fcbb" :answer/id #uuid "e0c1b5d2-c003-5d45-8add-3ec38941400e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "6{e}^{-2t}-5{e}^{-3t}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-342925/field-3/0117c9ffbcc8b00df900f42bfcc647471a6aeb60151a4ad76af805f885f868bf" :answer/id #uuid "f126cff3-2477-53fa-85a0-8ae16b664294" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-6{e}^{-2t}+5{e}^{-3t}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-342925/field-3/2eb633f4be30b710dda45ba5720f0f72a588df63ee7771bbb575e12ac341e482" :answer/id #uuid "6e2deca0-7317-5a15-8ab9-5dc2fdd44688" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{e}^{-2t}+{e}^{-3t}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-342925/field-3" :answer-field/id #uuid "4bfc881c-a9ca-57ab-8976-6bcc0476ad03" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "q-342925/field-3/7108c4464d1b2eea07bf53064655c7c7765fd4c5a1bb83ff500e7b974ed1fcbb" :answer-field/choices ["q-342925/field-3/4ab281c3671a69db36411303f42cb15b9aafe5742f3680c61dbd346008ea420a" "q-342925/field-3/7108c4464d1b2eea07bf53064655c7c7765fd4c5a1bb83ff500e7b974ed1fcbb" "q-342925/field-3/0117c9ffbcc8b00df900f42bfcc647471a6aeb60151a4ad76af805f885f868bf" "q-342925/field-3/2eb633f4be30b710dda45ba5720f0f72a588df63ee7771bbb575e12ac341e482"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-342925" :question/id #uuid "5a07952f-1818-5784-8ecb-b69e9feaafac" :question/math-academy-id "q-342925" :question/problem "Consider the following initial value problem.\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}t}+2y=5{e}^{-3t},\\,y(0)=1\n$$\n\nSelect the correct options in the reasoning below to find the solution using Laplace transforms.\n\nLet $Y(s)=L{y(t)}.$ Taking the Laplace transform of both sides of the equation and solving for $Y,$ we have\n\n$$\nY(s)={{field-1}}.\n$$\n\nThe partial fraction decomposition of $Y$ is\n\n$$\nY(s)={{field-2}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution to the initial value problem is\n\n$$\ny(t)={{field-3}}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we take the Laplace transform of both sides of the differential equation. Using the linearity property, we have\n\n$$\nL{{y}^{′}}+2L{y}=L{5{e}^{-3t}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula for the transform of a derivative, $L{{y}^{′}}=sY(s)-y(0),$ and the standard transform \n\n$$\nL{{e}^{at}}=\\frac{1}{s-a},\\,s>a,\n$$\n\nwe substitute the known values. Note that $y(0)=1:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(sY(s)-1)+2Y(s) & =5\\cdot \\frac{1}{s+3} \\\\ (s+2)Y(s)-1 & =\\frac{5}{s+3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe rearrange to solve for $Y(s).$ First, add $1$ to the right-hand side and find a common denominator:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(s+2)Y(s) & =1+\\frac{5}{s+3} \\\\ (s+2)Y(s) & =\\frac{s+3}{s+3}+\\frac{5}{s+3} \\\\ (s+2)Y(s) & =\\frac{s+8}{s+3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nDividing by $(s+2),$ we obtain\n\n$$\nY(s)=\\frac{s+8}{(s+2)(s+3)}.\n$$\n\nNext, we perform a partial fraction decomposition. We write $Y(s)$ in the form\n\n$$\n\\frac{s+8}{(s+2)(s+3)}=\\frac{A}{s+2}+\\frac{B}{s+3}.\n$$\n\nTo find the constants $A$ and $B,$ we first clear the denominators:\n\n$$\ns+8=A(s+3)+B(s+2)\n$$\n\nNow, we find the constants $A$ and $B.$\n\n- Setting $s=-2,$ we have\n\n$$\n-2+8=A(-2+3)+B(0)\\,⟹\\,6=1A\\,⟹\\,A=6.\n$$\n\n- Setting $s=-3,$ we have\n\n$$\n-3+8=A(0)+B(-3+2)\\,⟹\\,5=-1B\\,⟹\\,B=-5.\n$$\n\nThus, the decomposition is\n\n$$\nY(s)=\\frac{6}{s+2}-\\frac{5}{s+3}.\n$$\n\nFrom the table of Laplace transforms, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{L}^{-1}{\\frac{1}{s+2}} & ={e}^{-2t} \\\\ {L}^{-1}{\\frac{1}{s+3}} & ={e}^{-3t}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, taking the inverse Laplace transform of $Y(s),$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y(t) & =6{L}^{-1}{\\frac{1}{s+2}}-5{L}^{-1}{\\frac{1}{s+3}} \\\\ y(t) & =6{e}^{-2t}-5{e}^{-3t}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-342925/field-1" "q-342925/field-2" "q-342925/field-3"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "5eae6b5d-adff-53b2-970d-f0dcee58365f"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-342925"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-343063/field-1/2956bdedec89eeb561a89a68c70e46a726d9020827733b0a63db70e60c06d6de" :answer/id #uuid "f5b6ff33-b3c5-5e46-a551-22cd66674443" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2{s}^{2}-3s-4}{(s+3)({s}^{2}+4)}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-343063/field-1/9dce69befe7de26bdc2a4f1f808a1d067750b465e67bd0be43f5e8a087c59e45" :answer/id #uuid "821d3293-cec8-5424-936a-77a38f82223c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{-2{s}^{2}-3s-4}{(s+3)({s}^{2}+4)}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-343063/field-1/4e8f808dc7ef53155b69b9868acc1571017d78d296b9e51a782ba8a4d4f41db9" :answer/id #uuid "77612b3a-8002-505a-83a9-e88405f9af63" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{-2{s}^{2}-3s-4}{(s+1)({s}^{2}+4)}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-343063/field-1/2d128866709700d8630bfddc6f626b2cb59545da993398c79a2e19a2d4e7240b" :answer/id #uuid "659dae4a-45bd-52d8-8396-c265d99c0563" :answer/type :answer.ty